{"game": "risk-of-rain-2", "language": "english", "appid": 632360, "month": "2021-08", "window": 3, "start_date": 1629072000, "end_date": 1629763199, "month_true_total": 1959, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-13 02:45:04 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "98119385", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078968210", "personaname": "a.damn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cyphersproject/", "num_games_owned": 397, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 8886, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 754, "last_played": 1775932036, "avatar": "3617c7b6f83d9e6397009651c74a62cfd4535a64"}, "language": "english", "review": "si", "timestamp_created": 1629761417, "timestamp_updated": 1629761417, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517241418361663818", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98119294", "author": {"steamid": "76561198401430503", "personaname": "Globe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/_globe/", "num_games_owned": 182, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 48280, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 126, "playtime_at_review": 38692, "last_played": 1789272129, "avatar": "d2af59b44952982ff9d0ffd1a1470534c203bc38"}, "language": "english", "review": "risk of brain 2", "timestamp_created": 1629761261, "timestamp_updated": 1729738136, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98117902", "author": {"steamid": "76561198329283791", "personaname": "Weives", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/weives/", "num_games_owned": 274, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 16232, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6003, "last_played": 1670906839, "avatar": "bd44a769f5b88b66bb922967115499dbfdcf70b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "TL;DR: Do you like Roguelikes? Do you like Shooters? If you said yes to both, get this game.\n\nWith that out of the way, this game is an amazing contender for best roguelike in the genre. With an infinitely scaling loop system and two different options to end a run (plus a \"secret\" ending), this game has a little bit for anybody. With 10 Characters and a secret character, there's plenty of gameplay variety. With 108 items (not including scrap) and 24 equipments (not including the Fuel Array), there's plenty of the roguelike RNG to go around. \n(All the above numbers are after the Anniversary Update, 23rd August 2021)\n\nTopping that, you have 35 non-boss monsters and 6 variants that any of them can be an \"elite\".\n\nGoing from the beginning, barely scraping by the first stage, up to an expert running as long as you want with the power to smite a literal god (who isn't you by now, of course) until you inevitably get one-shot killed by a random nobody who's scaled out of control is a charm unto itself, and instantly makes you want to shout \"One more game, I'm obliterating this time\" and start a game without realising it's already been 3 hours of playing is the hook. \n\nIt goes without saying that for a game that doesn't have the most insane numbers of enemies, items, and characters like The Binding of Isaac, but still manages to have such a unique gameplay loop and addicting gameplay is impressive. Hopoo Games really outdid themselves.", "timestamp_created": 1629758799, "timestamp_updated": 1629758799, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98117726", "author": {"steamid": "76561198966208937", "personaname": "Imdstrynthewrld", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198966208937/", "num_games_owned": 354, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 18433, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1631, "last_played": 1745273927, "avatar": "89b5a5eb7572f91401da4ae1333534f69addea39"}, "language": "english", "review": "Might rain", "timestamp_created": 1629758490, "timestamp_updated": 1629758490, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "98117409", "author": {"steamid": "76561198141393601", "personaname": "Zethri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198141393601/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 17721, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 706, "last_played": 1778785971, "avatar": "1eb8d095cf5340aacb647cb5869f4a57cf41e8be"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1629757958, "timestamp_updated": 1629757958, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}